{{Short description|Football tournament group stage}}
{{Use dmy dates|date=May 2018}}
'''Group 2 of the 1930 FIFA World Cup''' began on 14 July 1930 and concluded on 20 July 1930. [[Yugoslavia national football team|Yugoslavia]] won the group, and advanced to the semi-finals. [[Brazil national football team|Brazil]] and [[Bolivia national football team|Bolivia]] failed to advance.

During the first match, [[Yugoslavia national football team|Yugoslavia]] unexpectedly beat group favorites, [[Brazil national football team|Brazil]] by A score of 2–1, they then proceeded to dominate their next match against [[Bolivia national football team|Bolivia]] netting 4 goals. [[Brazil national football team|Brazil]] also beat [[Bolivia national football team|Bolivia]] by a score of 4–0.

